"suggestion":"1. **Reduce Character Scale:** Shrink the Cub token to fit within a single grid cell (or slightly larger for emphasis) so it acts as a marker on the board rather than an overlay obscuring it. The board tiles must be fully visible. 2. **Establish Board Dominance:** Increase the contrast between the board background and the tiles to make the grid pop. Ensure the 'Start' and 'Goal' cells are visually distinct (e.g., colored backgrounds) so the player immediately understands the objective without reading the sidebar. 3. **Group Sidebar Content:** Visually subordinate the 'Storybook Journal' by reducing its background opacity or using a lighter border, making it clearly secondary to the board. Group the 'Moves/Time/Tiles' stats tightly at the top of the sidebar. 4. **Clarify Footer Hierarchy:** Move the legend (path/lit/goal) directly under the board or into the sidebar to keep the footer focused on actions. Ensure the 'Run' button is the primary call-to-action with higher contrast than 'Reset'. 5. **Integrate Streak:** Move the 'Streak' counter into the sidebar stats group or the header next to the title to reduce visual noise in the top right corner."
}

